From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReForge <reforge@flashforge>
Date: Sat, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mcu: relax TRSYNC_TIMEOUT for AD5M (fixes E0011)

The AD5M/Pro MCU ships Klipper-11 firmware on a shared bus that can
miss a sync acknowledgement within the default 25 ms window, causing
spurious E0011 communication-timeout shutdowns.  Doubling the timeout
to 50 ms gives the MCU enough headroom without affecting responsiveness.

Ported from forge-x ztune_klipper.sh (fix_enable_e11):
  sed -i 's|^TRSYNC_TIMEOUT = .*|TRSYNC_TIMEOUT = 0.05|' mcu.py

Signed-off-by: ReForge <reforge@flashforge>
---
 klippy/mcu.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/klippy/mcu.py b/klippy/mcu.py
--- a/klippy/mcu.py
+++ b/klippy/mcu.py
@@ -276,7 +276,7 @@
             s.note_homing_end()
         return params['trigger_reason']

-TRSYNC_TIMEOUT = 0.025
+TRSYNC_TIMEOUT = 0.05  # AD5M: relaxed from 0.025 to fix E0011 comm timeout
 TRSYNC_SINGLE_MCU_TIMEOUT = 0.250

 class TriggerDispatch:
--
2.47.0
